<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Mbaay</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      line-height: 1.5;
    "
  >
    <table
      align="center"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      style="
        max-width: 700px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        box-shadow: 0px 2px 8px rgba(99, 99, 99, 0.2);
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 20px;
      "
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding: 20px 0">
          <img
            src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dn3mokfxz/image/upload/v1738054206/Animation_-_1738053250952_hiecbo.gif"
            alt="Mbaay"
            style="width: 100%; max-width: 250px"
          />
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 0 20px; text-align: center">
          <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 25px">
            Hi, <span style="color: #333"><%= userName %></span>
          </h1>
          <p style="margin: 15px 0; color: #555">
            Congratulations on verifying your account! We're thrilled to have
            you as a part of the Mbaay family, a vibrant platform where cultural
            treasures, seamless transactions, and exciting features await you.
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 0 20px">
          <p style="margin: 15px 0; color: #555">
            At Mbaay, we’re passionate about preserving heritage while giving
            you access to a global marketplace. Here's what you can look forward
            to:
          </p>
          <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 10px 0">
            ✨ Shop Unique Cultural Products
          </h2>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0; color: #555">
            Discover an incredible variety of authentic cultural goods from
            skilled vendors worldwide. From art and fashion to handcrafted
            artifacts, there’s always something extraordinary waiting for you.
          </p>
          <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 10px 0">
            ⚡ Engage in Exciting Auctions
          </h2>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0; color: #555">
            Got an eye for rare finds? Join live auctions to bid on exclusive
            items and own one-of-a-kind cultural pieces. The thrill of bidding
            starts here!
          </p>
          <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 10px 0">
            👨‍🎨 Follow Your Favorite Vendors
          </h2>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0; color: #555">
            Stay connected to your favorite creators and vendors by following
            their profiles. Be the first to see their latest products,
            promotions, and updates.
          </p>
          <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 10px 0">
            🛒 Seamless Ordering Experience
          </h2>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0; color: #555">
            Ordering has never been easier. Place orders with confidence and
            enjoy a streamlined shopping experience powered by secure payments
            and reliable delivery.
          </p>
          <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 10px 0">🤝 Build Your Network</h2>
          <p style="margin: 10px 0; color: #555">
            Mbaay is more than a marketplace – it’s a community. Connect with
            other culture lovers, share experiences, and celebrate the beauty of
            diversity.
          </p>
          <p
            style="
              margin: 20px 0;
              text-align: center;
              font-weight: bold;
              color: #555;
            "
          >
            P.S. Be on the lookout for special promotions and exclusive offers –
            they’re coming your way! 🎁
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td
          align="center"
          style="padding: 20px 0; color: #888888; font-size: 12px"
        >
          <p>Powered By:</p>
          <img
            src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dn3mokfxz/image/upload/v1737988620/new_mbaay-removebg-preview_cyimbt.png"
            alt="Mbaay"
            style="width: 100%; max-width: 100px"
          />
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
